ed{2.51}$$\n\n## Summary\n\n| Quantity | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Cross-sectional area | 3.1416 × 10⁻⁴ m² (314.16 mm²) |\n| Normal stress | **159.16 MPa** |\n| Ultimate tensile stress | 400 MPa |\n| **Factor of Safety** | **≈ 2.51** |\n\nA factor of safety of ~2.51 means the rod can withstand roughly **2.5 times** the applied load before reaching its ultimate tensile strength, indicating a reasonably safe design.'}], 'model': 'qwen/qwen3.8-27b', 'n': 1, 'reasoning_effort': None, 'reasoning_format': None, 'service_tier': 'on_demand', 'stop': None, 'stream': False, 'temperature': 0.7, 'tool_choice': {'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'CalculationOutput'}}, 'tools': [{'type': 'function', 'function': {'name': 'CalculationOutput', 'description': '', 'parameters': {'properties': {'selected_tool': {'description': "The engineering tool/function selected to solve the problem. Example: 'calculate_beam_stress'", 'type': 'string'}, 'calculation_result': {'additionalProperties': True, 'description': "The result returned by the engineering calculation tool. Example: {'stress': 25e6, 'unit': 'Pa'}", 'type': 'object'}, 'validation_result': {'additionalProperties': True, 'description': "Stores the result of validating the inputs and calculation. Example: {'valid': True, 'warnings': []}", 'type': 'object'}, 'explanation': {'description': 'The final human-readable explanation generated for the user. Contains the formula, inputs, calculation, result, and assumptions', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['selected_tool', 'calculation_result', 'validation_result', 'explanation'], 'type': 'object'}}}]}}
